# ==============================================================================
# StockAssist AI — environment templates
#
# This repository is split into independent services, each with its own
# canonical, always-up-to-date environment template:
#
#   • Backend  →  backend/.env.example
#       Generated from the authoritative secret registry
#       (backend/security/secrets.py) by scripts/generate_env_example.py.
#       Copy to backend/.env and fill in real values.
#
#   • Frontend →  frontend/.env.example
#       Copy to frontend/.env. Only REACT_APP_* (public) values — no secrets.
#
# For the secret inventory, environment strategy, rotation policy, and
# leaked-credential incident response, see .claude/SECRETS.md.
#
# Real .env files are git-ignored and MUST never be committed. Only *.env.example
# templates (placeholders only) are committed.
# ==============================================================================
